Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:13.44,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:14.82,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Йошида
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:16.76,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:18.69,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.12,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Накуби Ута Макото
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:23.06,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ән
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.04,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:27.07,CN,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...
